! v0.75.0 regression: ethanol (CH3-CH2-OH) opt+freq.
! Pre-v0.75: stuck at max|g| = 1.51e-03 for 41 iterations because the
! dihedral enumeration in internal_coords::generate_internals dropped
! the nine torsions around the C1-C2 bond (the methyl-rotation DOF).
! v0.75.0 must converge in well under 50 cycles and produce 21 real
! vibrational modes (no imaginary frequencies).
%method  HF
%basis   6-31G(d,p)
%job     opt+freq
%grid    fine
%charge  0
%mult    1
%spherical
%opt_maxiter  100

%geo
